{"version":1,"content":"<p>希臘議會周五通過了一項法案，禁止15歲以下兒童使用社交媒體平台。此舉是在人們日益擔憂社交媒體對未成年人健康與安全產生影響的背景下出台的。該禁令將於2027年1月1日起生效。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583542.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:03:50.481156+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:40:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.723345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.723345+00:00","content_hash":"8c2ee83666b90b4abf7f9e03e9d07986e5b3a0f822c268aa5c16624823f8ed3e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}